    "updated_at": "2021-03-23T13:45:01Z",
    "body": "But what about a `<nomath>` element? You could write: `<math alttext=\"e^(i⁢π)\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></msup><mrow></math><nomath> (e^(i⁢π))</nomath>` to provide a copy-friendly version of your formula.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
